# Planning workflow

Planning in this repository runs through subagents. Do not hand-write an implementation plan.

Whenever you are about to draft an implementation plan, enter Plan mode, or call `CreatePlan`, run this chain:

1. `explore` subagents in parallel to map the affected code. Skip only if you have already read every file the plan will touch.
2. `plan-subagent` to draft the plan. Pass the ticket or request text verbatim; it cannot see the conversation.
3. `critique-plan-subagent` on the draft. Fix every violation it reports before the plan reaches the user.

This applies to every area of the repo, not only `server/`.

The one exception is a change small enough to need no plan: a single edit to a single file, adding no endpoint, type, migration, or test.

Both subagents can be wrong about the code. Verify their factual claims against the tree before acting on them.
